index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1423361015:1":{"text":"オーロナお姉ちゃんからもらった本はすごく気に入ってるけど、ボク……文字が読めないから、絵を見て内容を想像するしかないんだ……","source_cn":"欧罗娜姐姐，你送给我的书我很喜欢，但是……我不认识字，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2EEA4C065E8FFC5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1423361016:1":{"text":"ねえ、ボクたちの先生になってくれない？他のお友だちも、先生から色々教えてもらえれば……","source_cn":"你不可以当我的老师吗？还有我的朋友们，如果有老师愿意教...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x96359B97B1B9C3AA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1423361017:1":{"text":"ジェミー……実はね、私もそう思ってたの！あなたたちの先生になりたいって……","source_cn":"詹米，其实……我愿意！我愿意当你们的老师……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA45A49EA04D8957B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:24:1423361017":{"text":"ジェミー……実はね、私もそう思ってたの！あなたたちの先生になりたいって……","source_cn":"詹米，其实……我愿意！我愿意当你们的老师……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA45A49EA04D8957B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1423361018:1":{"text":"マーリンさん、それにロンロンとメイメイも、本当にありがとう。ようやく、自分のやりたいことを見つけられたわ。","source_cn":"梅林大人，满满，漫漫，谢谢你们这段时间陪我，让我找到了...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x00EFEC22EDBB27BB","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male"